  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance: Support  to public health systems and institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to public health institutions to enable evidence based policy to enhance the public health - set priorities and target groups - and enhance pandemic preparedness.

Main partner countries are Ghana, Malawi, Palestine, Ethiopia, Nepal and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
